{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118417","id":3517895138,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7RrtHi","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118417","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118417.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118417.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118417","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118417/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118417/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118417/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/eb3d2940e35ccd81de60369c237ef6fbceeaa5d6","number":118417,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Allow moving and resizing the embedded game window on Android","user":{"login":"syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176927541?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247","html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- ~Since the button bar is already quite crowded, I avoided adding extra button there. Instead, tapping outside the window toggles the move/resize mode. I'm open to suggestions for better ways to enable edit mode (move and resize).~\r\n    - ~Previously, tapping outside would hide the window or enable PiP. Now, both actions are handled by the minimize button. If PiP option is checked, it enters PiP mode, otherwise it hides the window.~\r\n\r\n- Added a drag handle to move the window and tapping it also reveals the resize handles. The resize handles hides after 2 seconds of inactivity (no movement or resizing).\r\n    - Since the button bar is already crowded, the minimize button is hidden in windowed mode (users can minimize by clicking outside the window). It remains visible in fullscreen mode.\r\n\r\n- The window can be resized up to 90% of the screen size. You can just switch to fullscreen for more than that :P\r\n\r\n- By default, the aspect ratio is locked. You can switch to \"Free\" mode by using the on-screen checkbox (as shown in the video below).\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c1976761-074d-4ac2-93f9-3a23c909a68b\r\n\r\nCloses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/13003","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":